<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - i2 Technologies started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - i2 Technologies started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it initiated coverage of i2 Technologies Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares of i2 Technologies were unchanged at 46-1/4.</p>
</text>
